  "traits": "Recommended Ability Score Increase: +2 Dex, +1 Wis\nSpeed: 30 feet\nSkill Proficiencies: Acrobatics, Perception\nWeapon Proficiencies: You are proficient with Short bow’s and Longbows.\nHijutsu Flexibility: Tsuchigumo Clan Hijutsu can use either Dexterity or Intelligence as its casting ability score.\nSpider Climb: When Wall Walking, you do not spend additional movement during movement and you do not make saving throws or checks to resist being pushed or pulled at disadvantage.\nWeb Weapons: As a Bonus action, you can conjure one ranged weapon with a bulk of up to 3 or up to two melee weapons with a bulk of 1. These weapon shares any weapon seals found on weapons you currently have that it qualifies for. They become brittle and break if another web weapon is conjured. If a ranged weapon has the Ammunition trait, you never need to roll for it as you make ammunition as part of each attack made.\nSpider Techniques: The Tsuchigumo Clan have access to a separate list of Jutsu unique to their Clan. You can add these Jutsu to your jutsu list instead of selecting jutsu from the Normal jutsu list(s).\nThird Eye: All clansmen have a third visual organ, located on your forehead, known as your Third eye. You can spend a Bonus action to open this eye for the next 10 minutes. While this third eye is open and unobstructed, you gain a rank of Mastery to the Search skill action and Passive perception, but it is unseemly causing all creatures unfamiliar with you, that sees you to react with caution, reducing their Attitude with you to Unfriendly.",
